# Title: Volume Shadow Copy Mount
# ID: f512acbf-e662-4903-843e-97ce4652b740
# Status: test
# Level: low
# Author: Roberto Rodriguez @Cyb3rWard0g, Open Threat Research (OTR)
# Date: 2020-10-20
# Tags: attack.credential-access, attack.t1003.002
# Description: Detects volume shadow copy mount via Windows event log
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(@Provider_Name:"Microsoft-Windows-Ntfs" AND @EventID:"98" AND @DeviceName:*HarddiskVolumeShadowCopy*)
